        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Any product candidates that we successfully develop and commercialize will compete with existing therapies and new therapies that may become available in the future.",
        "start_character": 46754,
        "end_character": 46919
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001104659-26-043782",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001104659-26-043782-8b83a285c3c51e2f",
        "accession_number": "0001104659-26-043782",
        "filing_date": "2026-04-15",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "The key competitive factors affecting the success of KPI-012 and any other product candidates that we develop are the product candidate’s efficacy, safety, method of administration, convenience, price, the level of generic competition and the availability of insurance coverage and reimbursement from government and other third-party payors.",
        "start_character": 47781,
        "end_character": 48122
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001104659-26-043782",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001104659-26-043782-8b83a285c3c51e2f",
        "accession_number": "0001104659-26-043782",
        "filing_date": "2026-04-15",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We also engage third-party service providers, as needed, for specialized development and regulatory support.",
        "start_character": 93225,
        "end_character": 93333
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001104659-26-043782",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001104659-26-043782-8b83a285c3c51e2f",
        "accession_number": "0001104659-26-043782",
        "filing_date": "2026-04-15",
        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We also intend to offer the platform on a platform-as-a-service basis, together with implementation support, maintenance subscriptions, and data analytics services, targeting mid-size biotechnology companies, contract research organizations, and pharmaceutical companies as our primary customer base.",
        "start_character": 10127,
        "end_character": 10427
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001104659-26-043782",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001104659-26-043782-8b83a285c3c51e2f",
        "accession_number": "0001104659-26-043782",
        "filing_date": "2026-04-15",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We expect to face competition from companies that have developed, or are developing, AI platforms and tools specifically designed for drug discovery and development, as well as from large technology companies offering general-purpose AI infrastructure solutions.",
        "start_character": 44768,
        "end_character": 45030
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001104659-26-043782",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001104659-26-043782-8b83a285c3c51e2f",
        "accession_number": "0001104659-26-043782",
        "filing_date": "2026-04-15",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We previously developed and commercialized two marketed products, EYSUVIS® (loteprednol etabonate ophthalmic suspension) 0.25% (“EYSUVIS”), for the short-term (up to 2 weeks) treatment of the signs and symptoms of dry eye disease, and INVELTYS® (loteprednol etabonate ophthalmic suspension) 1% (“INVELTYS”), a topical twice-a-day ocular steroid for the treatment of post-operative inflammation and pain following ocular surgery.",
        "start_character": 54531,
        "end_character": 54959
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001104659-26-043782",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001104659-26-043782-8b83a285c3c51e2f",
        "accession_number": "0001104659-26-043782",
        "filing_date": "2026-04-15",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "While we intend to assess the commercial viability of offering dedicated, on-premises AI systems to biotechnology companies, there can be no assurance that we will successfully develop, commercialize or generate revenue from this initiative.",
        "start_character": 4868,
        "end_character": 5109
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001104659-26-043782",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001104659-26-043782-8b83a285c3c51e2f",
        "accession_number": "0001104659-26-043782",
        "filing_date": "2026-04-15",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "With respect to any biologics product candidates that we may develop or acquire in the future, we would seek to establish appropriate sales and marketing capabilities at the time of any regulatory approval, either directly or through third-party arrangements.",
        "start_character": 49116,
        "end_character": 49375
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001104659-26-043782",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001104659-26-043782-8b83a285c3c51e2f",
        "accession_number": "0001104659-26-043782",
        "filing_date": "2026-04-15",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "With respect to our AI platform business, we intend to develop a direct sales capability targeting biotechnology and pharmaceutical companies, contract research organizations, and academic research institutions.",
        "start_character": 48765,
        "end_character": 48976
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001104659-26-043782",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001104659-26-043782-8b83a285c3c51e2f",
        "accession_number": "0001104659-26-043782",
        "filing_date": "2026-04-15",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "Although we do not believe Researgency would be considered a medical device, it is expected to be designed for deployment within biotechnology and pharmaceutical client environments to process proprietary biological data and clinical trial datasets, and its outputs may be used to inform or support drug discovery, clinical trial design, and regulatory submissions by our customers.",
        "start_character": 65620,
        "end_character": 66002
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001104659-26-043782",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001104659-26-043782-8b83a285c3c51e2f",
        "accession_number": "0001104659-26-043782",
        "filing_date": "2026-04-15",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "As an initial step toward potential commercialization of Researgency, we intend to use our accumulated KPI-012 clinical development dataset, which includes data from 79 patients across 37 clinical trial sites together with related regulatory submission materials, as a proof-of-concept validation environment.",
        "start_character": 10650,
        "end_character": 10959
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001104659-26-043782",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001104659-26-043782-8b83a285c3c51e2f",
        "accession_number": "0001104659-26-043782",
        "filing_date": "2026-04-15",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "Based on the CHASE trial results, we determined to cease development of KPI-012 and our MSC-S platform.",
